"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":23500,"output_tokens":175,"total_tokens":23675,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":3}}}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请逐段审查这段监控画面，给出可见证据的时间线和事件候选；证据不足时明确标记需要人工复核。","normalized_query":"请逐段审查这段监控画面，给出可见证据的时间线和事件候选；证据不足时明确标记需要人工复核。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将逐段审查这段监控画面，输出可见证据的时间线和事件候选，并在证据不足时明确标记需要人工复核","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这段监控画面","输出形式":"时间线、事件候选及人工复核标记"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_9ed620","text":"请逐段审查这段监控画面，给出可见证据的时间线和事件候选；证据不足时明确标记需要人工复核。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_fd371d","text":"读取输入的监控视频文件，按预设时间间隔或运动触发机制进行分段切分与关键帧提取，解析视频元数据（如摄像头编号、录制起止时间、分辨率），生成结构化视频片段列表作为后续分析的数据基础。"},{"task_span_id":"span_34bdcf","text":"基于视频监控场景的目标检测与行为识别能力，对分段后的视频序列进行逐帧扫描，识别画面中的移动目标、异常姿态及交互行为，记录各目标的出现时间戳、位置坐标及动作状态，输出带置信度评分的原始事件观测点集合。"},{"task_span_id":"span_ed749b","text":"结合视觉清晰度、遮挡程度与帧连续性等关键指标，对原始事件观测点进行证据充分性评估，将符合判定口径的事件整合为初步时间线，并针对置信度低于阈值或关键视角缺失的片段标注需人工复核标记，形成分级证据清单。"},{"task_span_id":"span_684c09","text":"依据任务指定的输出形式要求，将时间线节点、事件候选描述、证据质量评级及人工复核标签进行结构化汇总与格式编排，生成可追溯来源的审查报告草案，供下游环节直接调用或进一步确认。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_08f524","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将逐段审查这段监控画面，输出可见证据的时间线和事件候选，并在证据不足时明确标记需要人工复核。","params":{"视频对象":"这段监控画面","输出形式":"时间线、事件候选及人工复核标记"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_08f524","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将逐段审查这段监控画面，输出可见证据的时间线和事件候选，并在证据不足时明确标记需要人工复核。","params":{"视频对象":"这段监控画面","输出形式":"时间线、事件候选及人工复核标记"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:a15dd2a8-53cc-410d-ab0c-cc25a666c241"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n请逐段审查这段监控画面，给出可见证据的时间线和事件候选；证据不足时明确标记需要人工复核。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n请逐段审查这段监控画面，给出可见证据的时间线和事件候选；证据不足时明确标记需要人工复核。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-utils","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"frame-sampling","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"human-review-routing","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-detection","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-statistics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-tracking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"privacy-masking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"roi-mapping","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-video-event-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-embedding-index","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-object-analytics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-search","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-segment-extraction","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-stream-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:a15dd2a8-53cc-410d-ab0c-cc25a666c241"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_