stop immediately and make the whole visible response exactly that question.\",\n    \"If a downstream video skill fails, summarize the concrete failure and stop instead of debugging services.\"\n  ],\n  \"requires_confirmation\": false,\n  \"requires_human_review\": false,\n  \"capability_gap\": null\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"2782d38f-1ff0-45ce-b765-cd753e62ed4a","tool_call_id":"call_79b15d84ce7a4a5ea4111a27","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"编排计划返回了需要澄清的问题，但根据上传的文件上下文，我已经有视频路径。用户的核心需求是**逐段审查监控画面并生成时间线**。让我使用更匹配的技能链来完成这个任务。\n\n我将使用 `single-video-event-analysis` 技能来执行逐帧审查和事件分析。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":362,"prompt_tokens":17104,"total_tokens":17466,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":205,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":362},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":17104}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-f273f4be-05e4-90c6-82e6-b8802262be2a","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e2e-acbf-7c71-b8ff-8f6218b8ad10-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"invoke_skill","args":{"skill_name":"single-video-event-analysis","mode":"prepare","input_envelope":"{\"video_path\": \"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\", \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\"}"},"id":"call_110d0df0f77346109f061af6","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":17104,"output_tokens":362,"total_tokens":17466,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":205}}},{"content":"{\n  \"status\": \"prepared\",\n  \"skill_name\": \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n  \"input_envelope\": {\n    \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n    \"request_id\": \"6516a55a-8ada-41db-82de-30646d3c1433\",\n    \"skill_name\": \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n    \"scenario\": \"video_surveillance\",\n    \"capability\": \"skill_invocation\",\n    \"query\": {\n      \"raw\": \"<system_reminder>\\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\\n<hidden_step source=\\\"intent_recognition\\\" title=\\\"意图识别\\\">\\n改写后的任务：场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance\\n识别场景：视频监控 (video_surveillance)；场景模式：single；候选场景：video_surveillance\\n任务切分：\\n- 请逐段审查这段监控画面，给出可见证据的时间线和事件候选；证据不足时明确标记需要人工复核。\\n任务规划：\\n1. 读取输入的监控视频文件，按预设时间间隔或运动触发机制进行分段切分与关键帧提取，解析视频元数据（如摄像头编号、录制起止时间、分辨率），生成结构化视频片段列表作为后续分析的数据基础。\\n2. 基于视频监控场景的目标检测与行为识别能力，对分段后的视频序列进行逐帧扫描，识别画面中的移动目标、异常姿态及交互行为，记录各目标的出现时间戳、位置坐标及动作状态，输出带置信度评分的原始事件观测点集合。\\n3. 结合视觉清晰度、遮挡程度与帧连续性等关键指标，对原始事件观测点进行证据充分性评估，将符合判定口径的事件整合为初步时间线，并针对置信度低于阈值或关键视角缺失的片段标注需人工复核标记，形成分级证据清单。\\n4. 依据任务指定的输出形式要求，将时间线节点、事件候选描述、证据质量评级及人工复核标签进行结构化汇总与格式编排，生成可追溯来源的审查报告草案，供下游环节直接调用或进一步确认。\\n场景任务：\\n- video_surveillance: 我将逐段审查这段监控画面，输出可见证据的时间线和事件候选，并在证据不足时明确标记需要人工复核。；参数：{'视频对象': '这段监控画面', '输出形式': '时间线、事件候选及人工复核标记'}\\n已提取参数：{'视频对象': '这段监控画面', '输出形式': '时间线、事件候选及人工复核标记'}\\n任务提示：\\n- 提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧\\n- 提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等\\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\\n</hidden_step>\\n</system_reminder>\"\n    },\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    },\n    \"routing\": {\n      \"selected_skill\": \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n      \"allowed_skills\": [\n        \"analyze-video\",\n        \"batch-video-ingestion\",\n        \"camera-health-check\",\n        \"city-video-intelligence\",\n        \"duplicate-event-merge\",\n        \"evidence-package-generation\",\n        \"evidence-snapshot\",\n        \"ffmpeg-utils\",\n        \"frame-sampling\",\n        \"human-review-routing\",\n        \"object-detection\",\n        \"object-statistics\",\n        \"object-tracking\",\n        \"privacy-masking\",\n        \"roi-mapping\",\n        \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n        \"video-embedding-index\",\n        \"video-object-analytics\",\n        \"video-search\",\n        \"video-segment-extraction\",\n        \"video-stream-ingestion\"\n      ],\n      \"selection_owner\": \"lead_agent\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"legacy_invocation\": {\n    \"skill_dir\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/single-video-event-analysis\",\n    \"skill_file\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/single-video-event-analysis/SKILL.md\",\n    \"container_skill_file\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/single-video-event-analysis/SKILL.md\",\n    \"selected_data_sources\": [],\n    \"argv\": [],\n    \"env\": {},\n    \"parameters\": {},\n    \"working_directory\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/single-video-event-analysis\",\n    \"adapter_note\": \"Load the returned container_skill_file, follow its SKILL.md workflow, and use selected_data_sources/parameters as the legacy inputs.\"\n  },\n  \"next_steps\": [\n    \"Read container_skill_file before executing the Skill workflow.\",\n    \"Use selected_data_sources and parameters as the legacy inputs.\",\n    \"After execution, call invoke_skill again with mode='wrap_output' to produce SkillResult.\"\n  ]\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"invoke_skill","id":"4da39244-19ef-4991-84bd-5090dcc750ab","tool_call_id":"call_110d0df0f77346109f061af6","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":88,"prompt_tokens":18430,"total_tokens":18518,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":24,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":88},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":18430}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-9f72673c-c67e-915d-a42d-1d2e799a7e3a","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e2e-c0de-7bf0-852e-75c50be487db-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取单视频事件分析技能的工作流说明","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/single-video-event-analysis/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_82bcf59c4dea4b1b9d2c6244","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":18430,"output_tokens":88,"total_tokens":18518,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":24}}},{"content":"---\nname: single-video-event-analysis\ndescription: Analyze one local monitoring video for incidents after city-video-intelligence has routed the request, by extracting timestamped frames and having the LLM review visible evidence. Use for fight, fall, traffic accident, congestion, crowd gathering, smoke/fire, intrusion, illegal occupation, or other abnormal events. For direct user monitoring-video event questions, load city-video-intelligence first. This skill is the only custom event-detection entrypoint; YOLO/object detection may be used only as optional object context and must not decide event semantics.\n---\n\n# Single Video Event Analysis\n\n## Purpose\n\nUse this skill when the user wants to know what happened in a monitoring video.\nEvent detection is based on extracted frames and LLM visual review, not YOLO labels,\ntracking duration, ROI geometry, or rule templates alone.\n\n## Business Orchestration Gate\n\nIf this skill is loaded for a direct user monitoring-video request and no `city-video-intelligence` plan has already been executed in the current turn, load `city-video-intelligence` first and run its router script with the raw user request. Continue here only when that plan recommends `single-video-event-analysis`.\n\nDo not edit this skill's files or scripts during business execution. If the script fails, report the concrete failure and stop unless the user explicitly asked for debugging or implementation.\n\n## Execution Priority\n\n1. Use `write_file` to create a small input JSON file, then run `scripts/run.py` with `--input <file>`. Do not use shell heredocs or pass an inline JSON string to `--input`.\n2. Read the returned `review_manifest_uri` and use the listed `frames` as the review set.\n3. Inspect only the listed review frames in chronological order. Default maximum is 8 images.\n4. Read `all_frames_uri` or inspect denser frames only if a reviewed frame visibly suggests a possible event or is too ambiguous to classify.\n5. Produce the final event analysis from visible evidence and stop. Do not keep browsing frames after the conclusion is clear.\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\n```bash\npython single-video-event-analysis/scripts/run.py \\\n  --input <input.json> \\\n  --config <config.json> \\\n  --output <prepared_manifest.json>\n```\n\nUseful fields in `input.json`:\n\n- `video_path`, `file_path`, `raw_segment_uri`, or `video`\n- `camera_id`\n- `target_events`\n- `output_dir`\n- `coarse_fps`, `dense_fps`, `scene_threshold`, `dense_window`, `max_frames`\n\nFor ordinary business questions, omit `max_frames` so the script default samples across the whole video and exposes only 8 review frames. Do not use `max_frames` as the review-image limit. Do not rerun the script after a successful result.\n\n## Review Rules\n\n- Only report events that are visible in the sampled frames.\n- Use `unknown` or `requires_review=true` when evidence is blurry, occluded, sparse, or ambiguous.\n- Use at least two timestamps for temporal claims unless a single frame clearly shows aftermath, smoke, fire, a crash scene, or a fallen person.\n- Do not let YOLO output decide events. YOLO can only provide optional object context such as \"person\", \"car\", or \"truck\".\n- Include negative evidence when useful, such as \"no visible collision before 00:12\".\n- Never include internal thinking markers such as `<think>` or `</think>` in the final user-visible response.\n- If a draft answer contains hidden reasoning before a `</think>` token, discard that hidden text and answer only with the event result and visible evidence summary.\n- For negative findings, phrase the conclusion as evidence-bound, such as \"未在抽样审阅帧中发现交通事故迹象\", unless the reviewed evidence covers the full incident window.\n\n## Output Schema\n\nReturn a JSON-compatible result with:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"video\": {},\n  \"visual_timeline\": [\n    {\n      \"time\": \"00:00:12.000\",\n      \"frame_id\": \"frame_000012000ms\",\n      \"observation\": \"Visible subjects, actions, spatial relations, and scene state.\",\n      \"uncertainty\": \"Optional ambiguity note.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"events\": [\n    {\n      \"event_id\": \"EVT_...\",\n      \"event_type\": \"fight | fall_down | traffic_accident | traffic_congestion | crowd_gathering | smoke_or_fire | intrusion | illegal_occupation | other_abnormal_event | unknown\",\n      \"start_time\": \"00:00:10.000\",\n      \"end_time\": \"00:00:18.000\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.0,\n      \"severity\": \"low | medium | high\",\n      \"evidence_frame_ids\": [],\n      \"reason\": \"Concrete visible evidence and uncertainty.\",\n      \"requires_review\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"Short human-readable summary.\",\n  \"warnings\": []\n}\n```\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Do not call legacy rule-based event skills. They have been removed from this bundle.\n- Do not infer off-camera causes.\n- Do not fabricate exact counts when the frame only supports a range.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"c56a3d4b-88cc-48b7-a7e2-912469aef6ca","tool_call_id":"call_82bcf59c4dea4b1b9d2c6244","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在我来创建输入文件并执行单视频事件分析。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":104,"prompt_tokens":19653,"total_tokens":19757,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"au